{"title":"Lighting","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"playstation-icon-light","title":"PlayStation Icon Light","description":"\u003cp\u003eLight the night: light up your bedroom with the symbols and icons from the hugely popular and fun PlayStation gaming system. The PlayStation icon light illuminates the dark with a soft colorful glow\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":39356629647437,"sku":"","price":18.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1622844296722.jpg?v=1687052998"},{"product_id":"playstation-icons-light-xl","title":"Playstation Icons Light XL","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLight the night: light up your bedroom with the symbols and icons from the hugely popular and fun PlayStation gaming system. The PlayStation icon light illuminates the dark with a soft colourful glow Conversation starter: when hosting your next party or game night at your home, get everyone talking about your iconic, stylish PlayStation icons light. Instantly recognisable, everyone will want one Modes: This light has 3 different light modes \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":39458652782669,"sku":"","price":22.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1630961972118.jpg?v=1687053534"},{"product_id":"game-over-8-bit-pixel-light-color-changing-light","title":"Game Over 8-Bit Pixel Light, Color Changing Light","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"The Perfect Table Light For Your Gamer\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/7bf3ee49-133e-400c-8f2f-e1205653c03a.__CR0,0,2910,900_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/7bf3ee49-133e-400c-8f2f-e1205653c03a.__CR0,0,2910,900_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"cviv1o-vwql9s-d5ak0z-7bq4c3\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"o9a293-luv0y-qohje2-qvxu6f\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"colour phasing mode\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/b6e5a80c-7acb-444b-8574-9b05d5fd1a70.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/b6e5a80c-7acb-444b-8574-9b05d5fd1a70.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eColourful Fun\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eChoose a colour or select the phasing option and watch the word “over” change between different colours. The game might be over, but the party isn’t with an 8-bit light that flashes to the beat of your music.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"static colour mode\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/12a0362c-1aea-4689-819f-f5fc73a34151.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/12a0362c-1aea-4689-819f-f5fc73a34151.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eLots of Options\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eChoose your favorite colour, change it every day, or compliment your room with the steady- on static light option.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"kdaijw-ei7q2s-enjwk3-tzknh4\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Game Over light on table next to moniter\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/117007a3-917e-429b-9fd9-b9c8d80037a8.__CR0,0,2910,1800_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/117007a3-917e-429b-9fd9-b9c8d80037a8.__CR0,0,2910,1800_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"b3x1i9-7jaita-34zbsg-unsbnh\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"USB powered\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/4945673e-cf0e-4d11-9a31-6512a2ac4e5c.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/4945673e-cf0e-4d11-9a31-6512a2ac4e5c.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003ePower\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003ePower up the light by plugging in the included USB cord into any USB port whether that’s your laptop, gaming console, power bank, or your own USB adapter (adapter not included).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Back of light, showing buttons and power cord\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/16e13524-2fbe-401d-80bb-f8d7e7b76fff.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/16e13524-2fbe-401d-80bb-f8d7e7b76fff.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e3 modes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eIt's 3 colorful modes of fun! Choose to have the lights flash to the beat of music, steady- on mode in your choice of a static solid color, or color changing mode with 7 different colors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Game Over light next to keyboard\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/06e86e59-52bd-4a68-bf57-d6f53fe6709c.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/sc\/06e86e59-52bd-4a68-bf57-d6f53fe6709c.__CR0,0,900,900_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eGreat Gift\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eLooking for a gift for the friend who has everything? Light up collectables are a great solution for the gaming fan in your life. For guys, girls, or even your work bestie, we have a design for everyone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42737568088286,"sku":"","price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1650923168198.jpg?v=1650923375"},{"product_id":"multiple-color-5-meter-led-strip-lights","title":"Multiple Color 5 Meter LED Strip Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003e5 Meters multiple color Decorative LED strip lights\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRGB LED Strip lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e12V Safety strip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLenght: 5 Meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh efficiency and low energy consumption\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick and easy installation with sticker\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemote control with different color changing mode included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdapter power\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Atcomm","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42908760965342,"sku":"","price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1654455962537.jpg?v=1687054399"},{"product_id":"govee-rgb-smart-wi-fi-bluetooth-led-strip-lights10m-energy-class-a","title":"Govee RGB Smart Wi-Fi + Bluetooth LED Strip Lights(10m) [Energy Class A]","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product_tab_wrap\" data-index=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_tab_list\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_tab_item hvr-grow active\" data-index=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModel: H6110\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGovee RGB light strip can activate by music beats and get perfect work for parties and events' decorations. Set the Alexa led strips lights up as under-bed lighting, relax your mind and make your bedroom stunning and vividly beautiful.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• Smart Voice Control\u003cbr role=\"presentation\" data-uw-rm-sr=\"\"\u003e• Convenient APP Control\u003cbr role=\"presentation\" data-uw-rm-sr=\"\"\u003e• Music Sync Mode\u003cbr role=\"presentation\" data-uw-rm-sr=\"\"\u003e• Easy to Install\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_content_item product_content_1\" id=\"product_description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"page_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mobile-show\" data-animate_images=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_sub_img page_sub_img\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/264_2x_1_2d6b7d87-d4b8-4aa9-974e-87d376a64de4.png?v=1628567136\" alt=\"a screenshot of a computer\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/264_2x_1_2d6b7d87-d4b8-4aa9-974e-87d376a64de4.png?v=1628567136\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopifycdn.net\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/A1_271e6d1b-305f-482e-b2f8-3986e2e81e93.jpg?v=1626331662\" alt=\"a couch with a table and chairs\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap text lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMART VOICE CONTROL\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eWorks with Alexa and Google Assistant.Use voice commands for power on\/ off, colors, brightness, and modes.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/A2.jpg?v=1626148817\" alt=\"a man and woman sitting at a table with wine glasses\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap text lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCONVENIENT APP CONTROL\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eManage your lighting from anywhere in the world. Find both simple controls and amazing customization with the free Govee Home App.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/A3.jpg?v=1626148817\" alt=\"a hand holding a phone in front of a swimming pool\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text right lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMUSIC SYNC MODE\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eUsing the highly-sensitive built-in mic, your lights can dance along to the beat of your songs (or even your own singing voice).\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/P4_b62ae589-3228-4a75-b5dd-cb6d7e1cbed9.jpg?v=1626146538\" alt=\"a group of people on a stage\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAMBIENT BEDROOM RGB\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eEasily place alexa LED Strip Lights under and behind your bed or around your walls for stunning and vivid bedroom visuals that also relax the mind.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/P5_0b4a5ee8-0178-407b-a982-c3f2e7de0ac1.jpg?v=1626146538\" alt=\"a woman sitting on a bed reading a book\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42913546961118,"sku":"","price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1654543371559.jpg?v=1654544038"},{"product_id":"gaming-room-desk-setup-lighting-decor-3d-visual-led-night-lamp-7-color-change","title":"Gaming Room Desk Setup Lighting Decor 3D Visual LED Night Lamp - 7 Color Change","description":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Be63oQPZbQI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAmazing Innovative 3D illusion night lamp.\u003cbr\u003ePerfect gift for you or for your friend.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7 Colors : red, green, blue, yellow, cyan, purple and white\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTouch Mode: Press the touch button once to change one colour.   Hold switch down for 2 seconds to turn off.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow consumption, will not get hot after long period of  working, the high-quality LED, is soft and not intense, non-flicker, won't hurt eyes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsed in various environment, as decorative lights for home, bedroom, gaming room, living room, shop, Cafe, restaurant, party, or anywhere you like. Great as a gift idea\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePLEASE NOTE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Remove the surface protective film before use.\u003cbr\u003e•To avoid leaving fingerprint on the acrylic panel surface, only hold the board on the edge instead of front\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eParameter\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003eLight panel material: optical acrylic\u003cbr\u003ePower usage: 0.012kw.h\/24 hours\u003cbr\u003eLED life span: 10000hours\u003cbr\u003ePower: 0.5W\u003cbr\u003eVoltage: 5V\u003cbr\u003eConsumption: 3W\u003cbr\u003ePower supply: USB interface\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1* Optical acrylic panel\u003cbr\u003e1* ABS Lamp Base, size:85*40mm\u003cbr\u003e1* Micro USB cable, length: 1m\u003cbr\u003e1* User manual\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"FULLOSUN","offers":[{"title":"Headset","offer_id":42967411785950,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"PS Icons","offer_id":42967411818718,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Game Over","offer_id":42967411851486,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Roblox","offer_id":42967411917022,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gamer","offer_id":42967411949790,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Controller","offer_id":42967411982558,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"PS Icons 1","offer_id":42967412015326,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"PS Icons 2","offer_id":42967412048094,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Xbox","offer_id":42967412080862,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Can't Hear You","offer_id":42967412146398,"sku":"","price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pikachu","offer_id":49066727538910,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Super Mario","offer_id":49066729570526,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Game Zone Controller","offer_id":49066731995358,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Nintendo","offer_id":49066733043934,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pro Gamer","offer_id":49066736845022,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Game Zone","offer_id":49066739663070,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fortnite Option 1.","offer_id":49066742546654,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fortnite Option 2.","offer_id":49066744053982,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1655323696240.jpg?v=1655323737"},{"product_id":"govee-rgb-bluetooth-led-backlight-for-tvs-46-60-inches","title":"Govee RGB Bluetooth LED Backlight For TVs 46-60 Inches","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"banner_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGovee RGB Bluetooth LED Backlight For TVs 46-60 Inches\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eAdd Some Flair To Your Watch Party\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_list\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_text\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApp Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrightness +\/-\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRGB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_content_item product_content_1\" id=\"product_description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"page_wrap\" data-animate_images=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mobile-show lazyloaded\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap text\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA World Of Color\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eExperience the brightest colors from the comfort of your home and see everything in a new light. Watch your favorite media come to life before your eyes.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/1-2_2x_4db9bbe4-1929-430a-bd90-adf1a5e8eb44.jpg?v=1630376139\" alt=\"a man and woman sitting on a bed watching a television\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap text\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAn Open World Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eThe TV LED Backlights sync with the sound, creating a more engaging gaming atmosphere.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/98.jpg?v=1630380439\" alt=\"a man with headphones on holding a video game controller\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text right\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdeal Brightness Every Time\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eThe TV LED Backlights can significantly reduce eye strain and fatigue. The vivid RGB colors offer more immersive TV viewing.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/7.png?v=1630380439\" alt=\"a couple of women watching a television\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMake It Your Own\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eWith the Govee Home App, you have a variety of color and brightness options for your TV LED Backlights. Get access to multiple color options, 7 preset scene modes, and an adjustable brightness option.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/8_53f79f01-e556-4326-a522-5745705a3649.png?v=1630380439\" alt=\"computer keyboard\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text right\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLighting On All Sides\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eThe TV LED Backlights come with four 2.46 feet strips. Each side is connected with a flexible cable that can also fit your computer monitors.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/1_2.png?v=1630380439\" alt=\"a computer monitor with a cartoon character on it\" class=\" lazyloaded\" data-uw-rm-ima=\"ai\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43002936852702,"sku":"","price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1656010264420.jpg?v=1656010503"},{"product_id":"govee-neon-led-strip-light-10ft-3m","title":"Govee Neon LED Strip Light - 10FT\/3M)","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModel: H61A0(10FT\/3M) \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSegmented RGBIC Effects\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eUse the Govee Home App to access a selection of lighting effects that best suits your personal aesthetic. Your light will glow in a variety of neon-like colors to add a soft and pleasant ambiance to any part of your space.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/7_2d127b0b-dfc6-4572-be0d-c5559bbf718a.png?v=1632883434\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Voice Control\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003ePair your light with Alexa and Google Assistant to access the Smart Voice Control feature. Get hands-free access to various features on the Govee Home App such as Music Mode, where your light will sync to your favorite audio.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_list\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/625.png?v=1632883434\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/626.png?v=1632883435\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMake It Your Own\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eCustomize your lighting your way using our innovative RGBIC technology. The integrated IC chip allows for multiple color options on a single light. Your colors, effects, and more can be adjusted using the Govee Home App.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/9_e36da305-057a-43db-85e2-f698c1519060.png?v=1632883435\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoft and Delicate Lighting\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003e64 dynamic scene modes are provided, which you can pick one of your favorites to suit your moods, and set a timer to auto on\/off as your needs, Creating a pleasant lighting and sleeping time.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/112.png?v=1632883435\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSync with Music\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eWith 11 reactive music modes, the neon rope light owns brightness and colour can change simultaneouly when music beats change, immersive you in a real gaming scene.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e16 Million DIY Colors\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003e16 million color options are provided on Govee Home APP, you can degisn your preferable color via the color wheel or just adjust the color, mode by the control box, which provides you with a fantastic and cozy atmosphere.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43547313045726,"sku":"","price":65.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1666207778874.jpg?v=1666207989"},{"product_id":"led-strip-lights-wifi-wireless-smart-phone-app-controlled-5m-rgb-light-strips-kit","title":"Marvelights LED Strip Lights WiFi Wireless Smart Phone APP Controlled RGB Light Strips Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWifi Wireless Smart Controller\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDownload APP, you can easily change\/DIY the colors of led strip lights, brightness, color temperature, changing mode, changing speed, support microphone, music and timer mode. By using 1 APP, you can set groups to control many wifi light strips at the same time. 24 keys remote control(included) can be used if your phone is not spare.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy installation\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComes with a wifi controller and a mini IR remote and a small 4 pin connectors , a UL approved power adapter and a 5 Meters Waterproof led strips lights.Please carefully read the User Manual before Using. Please contact with us if you have any uncertainties about the wifi Controller.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePROFESSIONAL 3M TAPE \u0026amp; SAFETY GUARANTEED\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe strips light using 3M tape, specifically design for good adhesion to smooth surface of wooden furniture,plastics,paints,metals and glass etc. With excellent heat dissipation \u0026amp; IP65 waterproof, perfect for outdoor lighting and decoration. The voltage is 12V, extremely low-heat \u0026amp; touchable,equipped with short circuit protection \u0026amp; memory function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e16 Million different colors\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePersonalize your led strip lighting with a color palette of over 16 million colors and different tones of white light, dimming and brightness controls, suitable for kitchen, under cabinet, dining room, bedroom, garden, patio, balcony, party, wedding etc.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Marvelights","offers":[{"title":"5 meter","offer_id":45360331653342,"sku":"","price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"10 meter","offer_id":45360331686110,"sku":"","price":13.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1666208993173.jpg?v=1715537407"},{"product_id":"govee-envisual-tv-led-backlights-with-camera-dreamview-t1-rgbic-wi-fi-tv-backlights-for-55-65-inch-tvs","title":"Govee Envisual TV LED Backlights with Camera, DreamView T1 RGBIC Wi-Fi TV Backlights","description":"\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModel: H6199\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eGovee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlights\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eEnhanced Visuals Beyond Your Screen\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"product_func_list\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item fix_width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_text page_sub_text cancel_no_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGovee Envisual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRGBIC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAPP Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/H6199-2-M.jpg?v=1650599628\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight Kit with Govee Envisual Camera\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/H6199-2-M.jpg?v=1650599628\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eGovee Envisual Color-Match Technology\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"color_bar\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eOur Govee Envisual camera intelligently recognizes and captures the colors on your TV screen and applies then to your backlights automatically. Extend your playing universe beyond the four corners of your TV screen.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/2_496930c5-f417-46ae-be86-435a5ddb19c5.jpg?v=1636603807\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight Hands Free Voice Control\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/2_496930c5-f417-46ae-be86-435a5ddb19c5.jpg?v=1636603807\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eYour Voice Has Power\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"color_bar\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eEnjoy hands-free control? We’ve got you covered. Use Siri, Alexa, or Google Assistant to power your lights on\/off, change their colors, or increase\/lower the brightness to your desired level. With simple voice commands, you’ll save time while setting the mood you want.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cimg class=\"icon_img lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/679_4e21f67f-3007-42bc-9b3f-503f34b1c393.png?v=1636603806\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/679_4e21f67f-3007-42bc-9b3f-503f34b1c393.png?v=1636603806\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/H6199-1-M.jpg?v=1650607915\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight Kit with Music Sync\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/H6199-1-M.jpg?v=1650607915\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/4_aeb8a00f-8c3a-4e36-8a6a-f833883e9d6f.jpg?v=1618192495\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight Kit with Music Sync\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/4_aeb8a00f-8c3a-4e36-8a6a-f833883e9d6f.jpg?v=1618192495\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eLight Up Your Music\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"color_bar\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eIt’s time you fully immerse in your favorite songs. Sync the dynamic sounds of that live concert or karaoke night with vivid colors, greatly enhancing your musical experience.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/5_9a736467-3a8c-4364-8b95-829c12398af1.jpg?v=1618193171\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight for 65 inch\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/5_9a736467-3a8c-4364-8b95-829c12398af1.jpg?v=1618193171\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eEvery Side Covered\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"color_bar\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eGovee DreamView T1 TV backlights are perfect for most 55-85inches flatscreens Reinvent how you binge-watch your favorite TV shows with dynamic colors emitting from every corner of your TV.\u003cbr\u003eThis backlight is not optimized to work with curved TVs.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/8_b5455428-a5d8-467a-98e4-c8998f2841fa_large.jpg?v=1607739195\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight with 12 dynamic scene modes\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/8_b5455428-a5d8-467a-98e4-c8998f2841fa_large.jpg?v=1607739195\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e12 Scene Modes\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eCreate your epic gaming or casual movie night ambiance with 12 dynamic scene modes to choose from.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/7_73ea1f62-9580-4b30-bf59-c8df4cae1802_large.jpg?v=1608718632\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight Kit RGBW Light\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/7_73ea1f62-9580-4b30-bf59-c8df4cae1802_large.jpg?v=1608718632\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eSegmented Color\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eFor those who want more color, you'll love our segmented color control feature, made possible by our RGBIC technology. Personalize every segment on a single strip light for a more vibrant viewing experience.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"banner_wrap banner_1\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\" lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/8_333e95ef-556b-441b-85c4-3c8e7c93fc9d_large.jpg?v=1608718636\" alt=\"Govee DreamView T1 Wi-Fi TV Backlight Kit with Smart APP Control\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0512\/3489\/8105\/files\/8_333e95ef-556b-441b-85c4-3c8e7c93fc9d_large.jpg?v=1608718636\"\u003e\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"middle_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003eSmart APP Control\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title\"\u003eUse the Govee Home app to power your lights on\/off or select light modes from anywhere with a Wi-Fi connection.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"For 55-65 inch TVs","offer_id":47547110457566,"sku":null,"price":70.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false},{"title":"For 75-85 inch TVs","offer_id":47547110490334,"sku":null,"price":90.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1667769446035.jpg?v=1667769541"},{"product_id":"playstation-5-ps5-icons-light-xl","title":"Playstation 5 | PS5 Icons Light XL","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eLight up the Night\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLight up your bedroom with symbols and icons from the popular and fun Playstation 5 gaming system. The Playstation Icon Light illuminates the dark with a soft glow.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis light has 3 different light modes with standard lighting, special color phase effect, and music reactive mode.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44199950844126,"sku":"","price":22.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1684870027029.jpg?v=1684870434"},{"product_id":"playstation-5-ps5-icons-light","title":"Playstation 5 | PS5 Icons Light ","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-small\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eLight the night: Light up your bedroom with the iconic symbols from the hugely popular PlayStation gaming system. The PlayStation 5 Icon Light illuminates the dark with a soft glow that phases from white to blue\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-small\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eConversation starter: When hosting your next party or game night at your home, get everyone talking about your iconic, stylish PS5 Icons Light. Instantly recognizable, everyone will want one\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-small\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePerfect present: This instantly recognizable PlayStation Icon Light makes a great present for geeks and fans of the popular gaming system. Perfect as a unique stocking stuffer or birthday present\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-small\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFun gifts for fun people: For those looking for cool stuff and all things geek, crazy, and unique, we are proud to create top selling toys, mugs, collectibles, and presents that make people smile\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44199953531102,"sku":"","price":18.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1684870605219.jpg?v=1684870751"},{"product_id":"super-mario-bros-icons-light-decorative-light-up-figure","title":"Super Mario Bros Icons Light, Decorative Light Up Figure","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eClassic 64 Bit Collectible: Power up your room with a light featuring familiar icons of the original Super Mario series of video games, this cool night light is a perfect gift for any classic gaming fan. Micro USB operation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e3 Different Lighting Modes: Jam to your music with reactive lighting, set the mood with color phasing mode, or use the steady on mode light as a cool decoration for your game room or office. Measures 30 x11 cm (11.8\" x 4.3\")\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSuper merchandise: Level up with an officially licensed Nintendo item based on the popular Mario video games. Mario and his brother Luigi are loved among fans and are instantly recognizable characters\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFun gifts for fun people: For those looking for cool stuff and all things geek, crazy, and unique, we are proud to create top-selling toys, mugs, lights, decor, and presents that make people smile\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44241875075294,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1687465609030.jpg?v=1687465693"},{"product_id":"pac-man-and-ghosts-light-pac-man-collectable-figure-lamp","title":"Pac Man and Ghosts Light, Pac Man Collectable Figure Lamp","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis 30cm (11.8 inches) wide Pac-Man and Ghosts Light features Pac-Man and three of the Ghost Gang (Blinky, Clyde, and Inky) on a sleek black plinth. The light features three different modes, including standard lighting, colour phasing, and music reactive so you can use and display it to your liking. It's great for decorating your gaming setup, office, bedroom, or any living space. You can power the light with either the included USB cable or 3x AAA batteries (not included).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pac-Man and Ghosts Light is perfect for fans of retro gaming to add to their collection of classic gaming merchandise.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44241879269598,"sku":"","price":18.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1687465875864.jpg?v=1687467078"},{"product_id":"harry-potter-potions-bottles-lamp","title":"Harry Potter Potions bottles Lamp","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"aplus-header-class\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"harry potter gifts gifts for girls merchandise bedroom potion bottle  lamp light accessories merch \" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ab715cdb-3dc6-4caf-953e-9194b0e3e35c.__CR0,5,970,291_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ab715cdb-3dc6-4caf-953e-9194b0e3e35c.__CR0,5,970,291_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"oanlb4-6tesyc-v7rwji-1i96hy\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"55tbdn-qk3yjr-tm6to2-mdgjsk\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"harry potter gifts gifts for girls merchandise bedroom potion bottle  lamp light accessories merch \" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/5e40c564-b1f6-4eb6-a375-7ad59b566cbc.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m