is beautifully polished and uniquely labelled (with such delights as 'Bulbadox Juice'). Become a potions master like Professor Snape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"harry potter gifts gifts for girls merchandise bedroom potion bottle  lamp light accessories merch \" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f5f1b4c2-95fa-4437-9e21-b74b82db2a47.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f5f1b4c2-95fa-4437-9e21-b74b82db2a47.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eLIGHT UP YOUR BEDROOM\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eUse the 7 potion bottles to illuminate your bedroom or any other room.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eIn 3 light modes this provides family fun to explore the many possibilities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44241886216414,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1687466639963.jpg?v=1687466929"},{"product_id":"govee-rgbic-neon-tv-backlight-3m","title":"Govee RGBIC Neon TV Backlight - 3m","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCovers 48-55 inch TVs and 65-75 inch TVs,\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModel: H61B2\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the Neon TV Backlight, your gaming and movie nights will never be the same. Enhance your home entertainment with splashes of vibrant colors around your TV.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSegmented RGBIC Light: Change colors, brightness, and effects simultaneously.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOptimized Lighting: Made from neon casing for a brighter area.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStay Hands-Free: Smart voice control with Alexa and Google Assistant.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlexible Installation: Covers 48-55 inch TVs and 65-75 inch TVs,\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGovee Home Features: Customize colors or sync with your music.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRGBIC Lighting\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAPP Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_content_item product_content_1\" id=\"product_description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"page_wrap\" data-animate_images=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mobile-show lazyloaded\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img mb20\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/1-_-M_c6163449-e359-44de-9008-4115aa12256e.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img mb20\"\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/2_34e9fffb-102c-47b8-af4d-acf1da960b07.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"led_box\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"led_title\"\u003e180 LED Beads\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"led_subtitle\"\u003eNeon TV Backlight\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img mb20\"\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/3_7c079400-2e56-43bb-83f4-cdf4e99eb223.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs_box\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs_box_left\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs-title\"\u003eGovee Neon TV Backlight\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs-subtitle\"\u003eMore delicate and mesmerizing lighting effects\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs_box_right\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs-title\"\u003eOrdinary Light Strip\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"vs-subtitle\"\u003eLights are dim and not clear enough\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003e10,000,000+\u003cbr\u003eRegistered Users\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_list\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item fix_width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_img\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_text page_sub_text\"\u003eDIY\u003cbr\u003eMode\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item fix_width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_img\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_text page_sub_text\"\u003e11 Music\u003cbr\u003eModes\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item fix_width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_img\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_text page_sub_text\"\u003e64+ Scene\u003cbr\u003eModes\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item fix_width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_img\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_text page_sub_text\"\u003eRGBIC\u003cbr\u003eColors\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_item fix_width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_img\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/4_e3a6e280-87b9-42f3-969e-b558456b820d.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eInstall with Ease\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eStep1\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eWipe the back panel of the TV to make sure its surface is dry and clean before attaching the mounting clips. Select the positioning card according to the size of your TV, A or B.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/6_63015e22-ee23-4f67-9dc1-a4da9446935e.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eStep 2\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eStick the positioning card to the back edge of the TV as shown in the image. Install the mounting clips one by one based on the size of the TV as indicated by the positioning cards. Press each clip for 10 seconds to ensure they are fully attached.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/7_2ee93979-dc4c-4391-acaf-2e76fb0fd0ac.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eStep 3\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003e● For curved back panels, the corner mounting clips may need to be flexed when pressed onto the back panel to ensure they are attached correctly.\u003cbr\u003e● Always face the bottom side of the clip with the longer wall to the inner area of the back panel for better lighting effects.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/8_9267a388-df46-4d6f-8b4a-c2b75b85500b.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eStep 4\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eAfter installing all the clips, slowly remove the positioning cards. Starting with the mounting clip at the bottom right (facing the back panel), install the strip light on the mounting clips counterclockwise.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/9_5a21bd53-2db2-4c68-836a-eacf67f95f46.jpg?v=1652945153\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img mb20\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/5-_-M.jpg?v=1653910630\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45334451781854,"sku":"","price":70.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1715111233970.jpg?v=1715112224"},{"product_id":"govee-smart-rgbww-light-bulbs-1200-lumens","title":"Govee Smart RGBWW Light Bulbs 1200 Lumens","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModel: H6009\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake your home feel a lot brighter with these smart color-changing bulbs. Adjust between RGB colors as well as warm and cool whites for ideal lighting every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1200 Lumens: Makes your home brighter than other conventional bulbs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Bulb Colors: RGB colors plus warm and cool whites.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultiple App Modes: Features include music mode and wake-up mode.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWi-Fi and Bluetooth Compatibility: Have full control of your lights.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGroup Control: Save time and adjust multiple bulbs at once.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_content_item product_content_1\" id=\"product_description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"page_wrap\" data-animate_images=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mobile-show lazyloaded\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eGovee Smart Light Bulbs\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003ePower Your Home with Smarter Lighting\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_func_list\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/679_9b50a057-a9b1-4b73-b303-0fe45f35a29a.png?v=1645697270\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-01_5c3bb2b7-7d59-423f-8f5e-1d38dc40eb5b.jpg?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-02_bdb345d2-668e-4b77-83d1-6ff592e8d3d1.jpg?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eLights That Fit Your Daily Schedule\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eApply these smart light bulbs to your daily routine with easy-to-use timer functions and modes like Sunrise \u0026amp; Sunset. Set your bulbs to brighten when you wake up and dim when you fall asleep.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-03.png?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eDimmable Brightness You Control\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eBoost the mood and the atmosphere of your indoor space with our tunable white function. Select from 2700K soft warm white or 6500K cold white There is also a dimmable brightness option from 1 to 100.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-04.png?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eControl Your Lights Simultaneously\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eTake control of your smart LED bulbs and other Govee smart products using only the app. Just set a scheme and add each product, then they can be controlled together (2.4Ghz Wi-Fi required).\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-05.png?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eStable Wi-Fi \u0026amp; Bluetooth Connection\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eNot only support APP local control by Bluetooth connectivity, but also support App remote control by 2.4Ghz WiFi connectivity anywhere anytime. you can also use a simple voice command by Alexa or Google assistant.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-06.png?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eSave More on Your Electric Bill\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eOur LED technology reduces energy consumption by up to 90% without losing the brightness or quality of your lights. Reduce your electric bill with our energy-efficient light bulbs.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/07_721d719a-ca06-49fb-a8a1-0cfe49b035c4.jpg?v=1658136003\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_wrap F8F8F8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item text left\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_text page_text\"\u003eHigh CRI for More Efficient Lighting\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_sub_text page_sub_text\"\u003eOur light bulbs hav90 CRI, which allows the colors of household objects under the lighting to appear more vivid. Add a more natural look to your home with reliable lighting.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scence_item img\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-07.png?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner img mt-20\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/M-08.jpg?v=1658136488\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45334557884638,"sku":"","price":26.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1715112600944.jpg?v=1715112800"},{"product_id":"govee-curtain-lights-dynamic-diy-light-art-canvas","title":"Govee Curtain Light Netflix Edition (1.5m x 1.5m)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover a stunning light show with Govee RGBIC Curtain Lights. With 400 LEDs, you can create dynamic lighting effects and customize your own DIY light show. Add a special touch to any evening with these dazzling lights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBest Pattern Display Ability:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eContain 520 teardrop-shaped light beads, allowing for a higher pixel density.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMore Creativity with DIY Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eBring your creativity to the forefront with our multi-functional DIY Mode.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExpand Your Installation Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eIncludes hooks, adhesive tape, and seamless nails to provide multiple installation options.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMultiple Light Effects for Every Moment:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAmplify the coolest vibes for any holiday or special occasion.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEntertain with All Your Govee Lights:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eWith DreamView and Music Mode, you can interconnect these curtain lights with multiple Govee smart lights for better immersive lighting.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHands-Free Voice Control to Make Your Life Smarter:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eRemotely control these LED curtain lights via Govee Home App.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45334718742750,"sku":"","price":80.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_e9f8476f-b114-4bfd-aa10-d60eaf958e85.jpg?v=1758441018"},{"product_id":"govee-glide-wall-light","title":"Govee Glide Wall Light","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModel: H6062 6+1\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant to create a more impressive gaming room? With enchanting lighting effects, a customizable layout, and a sleek finish, Govee Glide is sure to do just that. The perfect way to highlight any feature, complement an existing color scheme and take your room design to a new level.\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiffused RGBIC Light Effects\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e40+ Stunning Scene Modes \u0026amp; Music Modes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmart App and Voice Control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCustomizable Design Layout\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEasy Installation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_content_item product_content_1\" id=\"product_description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"page_wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mobile-show\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"banner_wrap text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv cla