lti-color effects.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item image banner\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/49.jpg?v=1624270853\" alt=\"Govee Glide 6 mode\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/49.jpg?v=1624270853\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"scenes_wrap white\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title page_text_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003eInstantly Switch Up Your Surroundings\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title page_sub_text_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_sub_text=\"true\"\u003eWith more than 40+ dynamic scene modes, completely change your vibe with a single tap.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item image banner\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/44_2x_33bdbd8a-8b3e-4ad0-9987-c949ef3a93e8.jpg?v=1623750622\" alt=\"Govee Glide 6 mode\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/44_2x_33bdbd8a-8b3e-4ad0-9987-c949ef3a93e8.jpg?v=1623750622\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"scenes_wrap black bgc_white_important\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title page_text_important color_black_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003eReacts to Your Music\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title page_sub_text_important color_black_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_sub_text=\"true\"\u003eKeep your gaming sessions and parties vibrant and lit with 6 reactive music modes.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item image banner\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/50_2x_9633499f-9461-49f3-ab67-8b0b3d1cd0df.jpg?v=1623750622\" alt=\"Govee Glide 6 mode\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/50_2x_9633499f-9461-49f3-ab67-8b0b3d1cd0df.jpg?v=1623750622\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"scenes_wrap white\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title page_text_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003ePowerful App and Voice Controls\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title page_sub_text_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_sub_text=\"true\"\u003eComplete control from Govee Home app. WiFi-enabled hands-free via Alexa, and Google Assistant.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_sub_image\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/197_2x_83de8067-0b00-4d0c-b173-a0949f7d525b.png?v=1623750622\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/197_2x_83de8067-0b00-4d0c-b173-a0949f7d525b.png?v=1623750622\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item image banner\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/51_2x_520069bb-cc23-439f-8f56-1ce86f3d85c5.jpg?v=1623750622\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/51_2x_520069bb-cc23-439f-8f56-1ce86f3d85c5.jpg?v=1623750622\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"scenes_wrap white\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title page_text_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_text=\"true\"\u003eEasy Install\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sub_title page_sub_text_important lazyloaded\" data-animate_sub_text=\"true\"\u003eSimply click together and go. 7 interchangeable pieces work in any combination and at any length.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrap_item image banner\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/52_2x_a8ad436f-71f6-4447-ba18-5a99c2061211.jpg?v=1623750622\" alt=\"\" class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/4203\/0246\/files\/52_2x_a8ad436f-71f6-4447-ba18-5a99c2061211.jpg?v=1623750622\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Govee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45334808658142,"sku":"","price":110.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1715115476907.jpg?v=1715115821"},{"product_id":"tuya-rgbic-tv-backlight-strip-color-sync-lens-version","title":"Tuya RGBIC TV Backlight Strip Color Sync Lens Version for 55\"-65\" TVs","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__1659595749a98ba82b\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__1659595749a98ba82b-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__1659595749a98ba82b\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--large gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003eLet colors go beyond boundaries\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte subtitle\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTuya has upgraded the RGBIC smart magic light strip with a new color synchronized lens version, which allows you to install it on the back of the TV screen, capture the color of every pixel of the TV screen through the included lens, and display it simultaneously on the RGBIC light strip , allowing you to be more immersed and enjoy your favorite movies and TV shows.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRGBIC TV background light strips use external lenses and specialized color capture technology to freely display corresponding colors in conjunction with RGBIC magic light strips. Whether you are browsing built-in TV content such as Netflix, Youtube or digital TV programs, or external devices such as PS5, Xbox, Switch and computer equipment, you can always use external lighting lenses to truly connect the TV and light strips. Connect to achieve the best results.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003csection id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__16596930165a3f7247\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"isolate\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rich-text content-container color-background-1 gradient rich-text--full-width content-container--full-width section-template--16593656185065__16596930165a3f7247-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rich-text__wrapper rich-text__wrapper--center page-width\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rich-text__blocks center\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"rich-text__heading rte h1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial feature\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__165959592742d532c5\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__165959592742d532c5-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet image-with-text__grid--reverse\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media image-with-text__media--adapt gradient color-background-1 global-media-settings media\"\u003e\u003cimg srcset=\"\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/9b0b32bd72bc2506c1e60af863237568_13791cc3-b689-468e-8cf6-5b7c6cf9bb75.png?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=165 165w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/9b0b32bd72bc2506c1e60af863237568_13791cc3-b689-468e-8cf6-5b7c6cf9bb75.png?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=360 360w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/9b0b32bd72bc2506c1e60af863237568_13791cc3-b689-468e-8cf6-5b7c6cf9bb75.png?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=535 535w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/9b0b32bd72bc2506c1e60af863237568_13791cc3-b689-468e-8cf6-5b7c6cf9bb75.png?v=1678703775 679w\" src=\"https:\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/9b0b32bd72bc2506c1e60af863237568_13791cc3-b689-468e-8cf6-5b7c6cf9bb75.png?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=1500\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1300px) 600px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) \/ 2), calc((100vw - 50px) \/ 2)\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"679\" height=\"679\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__165959592742d532c5\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003eHD lens color reflection\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte subtitle\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTuya RGBIC TV background light strip (color sync lens version) uses a high-definition 1080P dedicated color recognition lens. When installed in the middle of the TV, the high-definition lens can intelligently capture the color changes displayed on the screen, thereby reflecting on the light strip behind the TV. superior. With Tuya's TV backlight strips, your gaming and movie effects will never be the same again. Brightly colored lights will dance around the TV, reflecting color effects on the screen, enhancing your home entertainment experience and extending your sensory world beyond the corners of the TV screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__1659596008271527b4\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__1659596008271527b4-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media image-with-text__media--adapt gradient color-background-1 global-media-settings media\"\u003e\u003cimg srcset=\"\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Pe8ySTb6_4x_ef48d41e-f386-4da1-8318-88d19cb6f7bd.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=165 165w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Pe8ySTb6_4x_ef48d41e-f386-4da1-8318-88d19cb6f7bd.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=360 360w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Pe8ySTb6_4x_ef48d41e-f386-4da1-8318-88d19cb6f7bd.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=535 535w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Pe8ySTb6_4x_ef48d41e-f386-4da1-8318-88d19cb6f7bd.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=750 750w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Pe8ySTb6_4x_ef48d41e-f386-4da1-8318-88d19cb6f7bd.jpg?v=1678703775 1000w\" src=\"https:\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/Pe8ySTb6_4x_ef48d41e-f386-4da1-8318-88d19cb6f7bd.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=1500\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1300px) 600px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) \/ 2), calc((100vw - 50px) \/ 2)\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__1659596008271527b4\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003eInnovative RGBIC rainbow light technology\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte subtitle\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTuya RGBIC TV background light strip (color synchronized lens version) can be adjusted to multiple colors through the Tuya Home App LED light strip. Our RGBIC technology allows the light strip to have multiple independent IC chips, allowing the light to display multiple different colors at the same time. s color. Each strip has a rainbow-like light show. With high-definition color lenses, the corresponding colors can be displayed in different parts. Compared with traditional light strips that can only display the same color at the same time, the RGBIC version can be more freely displayed. reflect the color you need.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__16595960465d050be4\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__16595960465d050be4-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet image-with-text__grid--reverse\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__16595960465d050be4\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003eVarious colors and phantom changes\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte subtitle\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to using the lens to reflect the color of the screen, the Tuya RGBIC TV background light strip also provides a variety of single color and illusion modes to choose from, with adjustable light and dark functions. If you don't like to let the lens determine the color, you can also choose multiple dynamic modes through the App at any time, such as flashing, breathing, strobe, gradient, etc. At the same time, you can also adjust the brightness and change speed of the light, stop it completely or proceed The changes you specify.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__165959608300ce642c\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__165959608300ce642c-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media image-with-text__media--adapt gradient color-background-1 global-media-settings media\"\u003e\u003cimg srcset=\"\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/71XHZkfMfOL._AC_SX679.jpg?v=1678703975\u0026amp;width=165 165w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/71XHZkfMfOL._AC_SX679.jpg?v=1678703975\u0026amp;width=360 360w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/71XHZkfMfOL._AC_SX679.jpg?v=1678703975\u0026amp;width=535 535w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/71XHZkfMfOL._AC_SX679.jpg?v=1678703975 679w\" src=\"https:\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/71XHZkfMfOL._AC_SX679.jpg?v=1678703975\u0026amp;width=1500\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1300px) 600px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) \/ 2), calc((100vw - 50px) \/ 2)\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"679\" height=\"679\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__165959608300ce642c\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003eEasy installation\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte subtitle\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTuya RGBIC TV backlight strip supports screen sizes of 55-65 inches.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe back of the light strip is equipped with an exclusive easy-to-tear adhesive tape. You only need to tear it off and paste it directly on the back of the TV screen to fix it. The super sticky and easy-to-install design is suitable for most TV sizes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*RGBIC TV background light strip does not support customization and is suitable for larger TV screens. If your screen is not between 55-65 inches, it is recommended to choose our HDMI style or computer screen style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__1659596114b1b9aff6\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__1659596114b1b9aff6-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet image-with-text__grid--reverse\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__media image-with-text__media--adapt gradient color-background-1 global-media-settings media\"\u003e\u003cimg srcset=\"\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=165 165w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=360 360w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=535 535w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=750 750w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=1070 1070w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=1500 1500w,\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775 1500w\" src=\"https:\/\/nordecohk.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/O1CN015y3f2Sg1PlXm2SqN6y__2250531881-0-cib.jpg?v=1678703775\u0026amp;width=1500\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1300px) 600px, (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 130px) \/ 2), calc((100vw - 50px) \/ 2)\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__1659596114b1b9aff6\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003emusic change function\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte subtitle\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you don’t want to use the lens to control the lighting effects, you can also use the built-in microphone of the light bar to receive the beat of external music and change the color of the light. The color of the light will change in line with the ups and downs of the music, which is also an interesting experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-template--16593656185065__150febfa-7f74-44b5-a6e6-d33285181fb7\" class=\"shopify-section section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text image-with-text--no-overlap page-width isolate section-template--16593656185065__150febfa-7f74-44b5-a6e6-d33285181fb7-padding\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__grid grid grid--gapless grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ImageWithText--template--16593656185065__150febfa-7f74-44b5-a6e6-d33285181fb7\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient color-background-1 content-container\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h1\"\u003eSupport Tuya Home smart home control\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"image-with-text__text rte body\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLike other Tuya smart lamps, the Nordeco RGBIC TV background light strip supports various lighting effects controlled through the App, and can also be controlled in conjunction with other Tuya lamps, such as turning on\/off the device together, changing light colors, setting scene control and remote control etc.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Tuya","offers":[{"title":"For 27–43\" TVs","offer_id":48273539989726,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"For 55–65\" TVs","offer_id":48273540022494,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1715540613096.jpg?v=1715540822"},{"product_id":"rgb-neon-rope-lights-ip67-waterproof-bluetooth-app-control-flexible-silicone-design","title":"RGB Neon Rope Lights IP67 Waterproof, Bluetooth APP Control, Flexible Silicone Design","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEnter the Neon World】 Neon lights strips offer a richer color palette than regular LED strip lights. Decorate your bedroom, gaming room, or accent wall with neon rope light, and turning them on feels like stepping into a cyberpunk world. Neon LED rope lights have different modes to suit a variety of occasions (Note: neon rope lights can only present one color at a time)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Shape It to Your Desire】 Flexible neon led lights for bedroom can be easily bent into different shapes. You can simply install them around the contours of objects or unleash your imagination to bend them into shapes like hearts, guitars, game controllers, and more to match any style you desire. (Tip: secure them with the included screws and clips)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Two Ways to Control】 Neon rope lights indoor can be controlled via an app or the included remote. The app allows for fine-tuned personalization with 16 million color combinations, preset scene modes, music mode, and timer functions. The app \"illumihome\" is available on Google Play and the iOS App Store\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Outdoor Use Supported】 Neon RGB lights for room aren't just for indoor ambiance enhancement; they can also be used for outdoor decoration. The neon strip lights are IP67 waterproof, so you don't have to worry about water damage. Note: The power supply and controller (the white box with a QR code) are not waterproof\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Durable and Energy-Efficient】 The neon leds for bedroom undergo durability testing before shipment, ensuring brightness and lifespan. A 16.4ft neon light strip contains 300 LED beads, providing ample brightness for various occasions. It also comes with a 24V power supply, which consumes less energy and generates less heat than traditional neon lights. (Package contents: 16.4ft neon light strip *1, control box *1, power adapter *1,screw and fixture set *1)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"5 meter","offer_id":46104104206558,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"10 meter","offer_id":46104104239326,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1732487957858.jpg?v=1732488530"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-35-32-cm-game-room","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor\n35×32 cm - Game Room","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePERSONALIZED NEON SIGNS: Game room neon lights are eye-catching and create a lively atmosphere for your game room, party, battle station. Lighting up your world with this unforgettable neon wall decor sign can make your walls bright and artistic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEASY TO OPERATE: Game room LED neon signs(13.2\" * 14\") with a 59.1\" USB cable can be connected to computer\/charger\/power bank. There is 2 pre-drilled holes behind the wall neon light, you can hang it on the wall or put it on the table according to your needs, fast and easy to install.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eENERGY-SAVING: There is a switch on the USB cable. If you don't want to use LED light up sign, you can turn off the power with the switch. 5V low voltage advanced electrode system enables lower energy consumption, more energy saving and environmental protection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSAFETY \u0026amp; NO RISK: The game room LED bedroom sign lights is made of top-quality flexible silicone LED strip lights and sturdy \u0026amp; lightweight acrylic plate. No broken glass, no harmful materials, even if it is placed in the bedroom, it can ensure your safety. Don't worry!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eROMANTIC DECORATION\u0026amp; EXCELLENT GIFT CHOICE: This neon light is perfect for playrooms, kids' rooms, game wall decorations, and provides a warm atmosphere for game lovers! Not only that, this neon light is also the perfect gift for family, friends, kids, game lovers, etc.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665533550814,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_596b9273-42b9-4793-a177-e9fe9b08489d.jpg?v=1762710283"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-22-20-cm-game-controller","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 22×20 cm - Game Controller","description":"","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665552589022,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9f2a64e9-6234-4a63-8499-04a6294384d5.jpg?v=1762711109"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-38-25-cm-handheld-game","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 38×25 cm - Handheld Game","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEye-Catching Gaming Neon Sign: Add a Touch of Magic to Your Gaming Setup with Our Vibrant and Attention-Grabbing Gaming Neon Sign, Designed Specifically for Gamers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasy Installation: Our Gaming Neon Sign Is Mounted on a High-Quality Clear Backboard with Pre-Drilled Holes, Making It Incredibly Easy to Install and Move Around. Simply Hang It on a Wall and Plug in - Hassle-Free Setup for Instant Gaming Vibes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIndependent Switch for Convenience: The Gaming Neon Night Light Features Its Own Independent Switch, Allowing You to Control the Illumination Without the Hassle of Frequent Plugging. Effortlessly Create the Perfect Ambiance for an Immersive Gaming Experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eVersatile Decor: Whether You're a Console Gamer, Love Decorating Your Bedroom or Game Room, Or Want to Add Character to Your Living Space, Our Gaming Neon Sign Is Perfect for Hanging on Consoles, Bookshelves, Bedrooms, Game Rooms, Cafes, Bars, Game-Themed Hotels, And Man Caves, Adding a Unique Touch to Any Space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSafe and Convenient Power Source: Our Gaming Neon Sign Is Powered by a USB Charging Cable, With an On\/Off Switch for Easy Control. The Soft and Non-dazzling LED Tube Is Touchable Even When Turned On, Ensuring a Safe Gaming Environment. Just Plug It into an Adapter or a Computer USB Port and Enjoy the Glow!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665575461086,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_3d113b87-07c3-4c57-a087-85f88fd9214a.jpg?v=1762711937"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-33-31-cm-gamer-skull","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 33×31 cm - Gamer\/Skull","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGAMER STYLE: The \"Gamer Skull\" neon sign is designed with a unique gamer style, featuring an eye-catching skull pattern that injects a strong gaming atmosphere into your room. It's an ideal choice for every true gaming enthusiast.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eAMAZING GAMER DECOR \u0026amp; GIFT: Enhance your gaming setup with this stunning neon gaming sign – a perfect addition that complements your consoles and reflects your identity as a passionate gamer. Ideal for birthdays, Christmas, and other celebrations, it makes an outstanding gift for gamers and tech enthusiasts, celebrating their shared passion.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEASY HANGING: Convenient to install, it comes with detailed hanging instructions, allowing you to effortlessly set it up even without professional skills. The straightforward hanging process enables you to quickly showcase the unique charm of the \"Gamer Skull\" neon sign in your space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eVERSATILE APPLICATION: Whether as a standout piece in a gaming room or placed in a bedroom, office, or entertainment space, this neon sign can be a captivating decor item. Its unique design makes it suitable for various occasions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDIMMABLE FEATURE: This product comes with a dimmable feature, allowing you to effortlessly control the light intensity. Whether you need bright illumination or a warm ambient glow, it can meet your preferences. With easy adjustments, create the perfect lighting for different occasions and moods.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665587159262,"sku":null,"price":28.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f8eb9484-69f4-4be2-95f1-7b5a12903563.jpg?v=1762712570"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-39-32-cm-game-time","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 39×32 cm - Game Time","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eUNIQUE GAME TIME SIGN:Game time sign are eye-catching and create a lively atmosphere for your game room, party, battle station. New choice to game lovers for home and wall decoration\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHIGN-QUALITY MATERIALS:Game time neon lights sign for home is made of durable and sturdy plastic and flexible silicon LED strip lights,no risk of glass breakage or leakage of hazardous materials.And it is energy-saving and durable,will not get too hot,teens and kids friendly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDIMMABLE \u0026amp; USB POWER:The game time led sign adopts 5 voltage with ON and OFF switch,just plug in the USB port,power bank, or PC etc to turn on the neon light freely.It has a dimmable design so that you can adjust the light level to suit your needs,so you can quickly and accurately create the atmosphere you want\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIMPRESSIVE DECORATION \u0026amp; GIFT:Game theme sign is widely used in wall decor, game zone, game room , party, men caves and livingroom.It is an excellent gift for parents, lovers, boyfriends, friends, and children\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEASY to USE \u0026amp; GET SERVICE:The game neon light is equipped with 59in usb power cord, 23in hook chains,and 2 strick hooks to fit the pre-drilled holes,you can quickly hang it on the wall.If you have any problem for neon sign or you need any help, please contact us with no hesitation , we will provide you problems within 24 hours\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665604100318,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_8df0a091-6e9e-4dcd-b4c3-c63bb3f11067.jpg?v=1762713201"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-39-32-cm-gamer","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 39×32 cm - Gamer","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBest Addition to the Room: ReyeeInc gaming neon sign makes any room feel like an arcade room with the lights and multiple colors, super cute for kids gamer bedroom, well enhance gaming themed room or video room, perfect addition to any gaming area or kid’s bedroom.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBright and Cool: This gaming room decor is very cute, the colors are vibrant and bright, creating a mesmerizing glow that enhances the gaming atmosphere and makes it a special space for gaming enthusiasts. The sign not only enhances the visual appeal of the room but also adds an element of personal style and taste.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePerfect Dimmable Design: This game room accessories and decor adds a dimmer switch, offering 6 levels of brightness to set. Short press \"+\" and \"-\" buttons or long press for stepless brightening and dimming to meet your different lighting needs, it looks great in a dim setting and also acts as a night light when kid goes to sleep.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSafe and Low Energy Consumption: The multi-colored gamer decor neon light is well made with the silicone LED neon tubing channel set into a clear acrylic Lucite backing. It is very sturdy, well-constructed, and made to last, ensuring that it will continue to shine brightly for a long time. The power source is a USB cord, no batteries needed, it only requires a usb 5 volt power adapter (NOT included).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasy to Install and Use: It comes with all the necessary components, premade holes in the backing for easy wall mounting, package comes with hanging chain and screws, offers two ways to install as you prefer. The cord is nearly 6.5FT long, has a simple off\/on switch with settings for brightness right on it, so you don’t need to unplug it to turn it off, so easy to use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665607835870,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9c60507b-a153-4253-befa-e3f53790917f.jpg?v=1762713739"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-30-14-cm-game-zone","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 30×14 cm - Game Zone","description":"","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665609081054,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_fd48d86d-9282-4136-a04e-fe715e4ab6ac.jpg?v=1762714293"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-27-18-cm-game-room","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 27×18 cm - Game Room","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExclusive Colorful GAME ROOM Neon Sign】：Hanging it in the room, light up your gorgeous game room. Brand new appearance, 5 neon colors matched, creative letter shapes and headset mark , perfect eyes-catching game room decor sign for bedroom wall. Making a amazing and artistic atmosphere for you\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Plug and Play】: Light up this neon gaming sign. Let's going into the game world with the magical glows. Equipped ON\/OFF Switch with USB port. Easy to turn on and off, Adapted with computer, laptop, power bank, charger plug, usb socket. 2 install ways be offered: hanging or fixing it on wall. (2 pre-drilled holes on acrylic board and 0.5 meter hanging chain.)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Energy Savinhg \u0026amp; Durable】: 50,000 Hours lasting lifespan. Advanced 5V low output voltage, safe and saving energy. No needing repeat plugging with switch. Taking led chips as light source, longer lifespan than traditional gamer neon sign. Flexible silicone led strips light matched with highly transparent acrylic plate, making the light brighter and more fantastic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Amazing Gift Choice】: This gameroom decoration suits for individual and business using. Wonderful neon signs for wall decor for gamer room, game zone, party, club, man cave,bar, bedroom, boy’s room. Also perfect gift for friends, gamers, family members, lovers, boyfriends, boys, children, teenagers, adult etc\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【What You Get】:We provide 2 Years service for this game wall sign. The package included: 1* GAME ROOM sign. Size: 15.7 x 9.8 inch; 6.56ft\/ 200cm USB cable; 1.64 ft\/ 50cm stainless steel hanging chain; If you have any problem and question, please feel free to contact us any time\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665611735262,"sku":null,"price":22.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f5a3b3e2-91e2-48c6-810c-0e3192d54d1f.jpg?v=1762714628"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-40-26-cm-game-controller","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 40×26 cm - Game Controller","description":"","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665613045982,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_1f5e43c9-587a-4c0f-b924-129bf7c335c7.jpg?v=1762896200"},{"product_id":"led-light-neon-sign-for-wall-decor-37-31-cm-gamer","title":"LED Light Neon Sign For Wall Decor 37×31 cm - Gamer","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCon un aspecto más realista y cada vez más transmisivo, nuestras luces de neón para juegos crearán un ambiente increíble en tu habitación. Silencioso y seguro, perfecto para decoración de habitación de juegos y adolescentes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSeguro y ahorro de energía y duradero: nuestro letrero de neón para juegos está hecho de tablero acrílico de alta calidad y tiras de luces LED, lo que hace que la transmisión de luz sea extremadamente fuerte, suave y uniforme. Con un avanzado sistema de electrodos de 5 V de bajo voltaje, silencioso y silencioso, seguro al tacto, bajo consumo de energía y sin calor. Puede funcionar al menos 50.000 horas o más\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExcelente decoración y regalo de sala de jugadores: el letrero de neón para jugadores es el complemento perfecto para salas de juegos y una gran decoración para habitaciones de niños, fiestas, eventos de día festivo y clubes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEsta luz de neón para gamepad también es un regalo ideal para adolescentes y cualquier jugador, y una gran opción de regalo para cumpleaños, Navidad y otras ocasiones\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFácil de instalar y usar: tablero transparente de alta calidad preperforado con 2 ganchos para que puedas colgar el letrero de neón en la pared o colocarlo en tu computadora. Alimentado por un cable USB (1,8 m). Simplemente conéctalo al puerto de tu computadora o al puerto USB para encender el letrero de neón en interiores o exteriores. Muy fácil de instalar y operar\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47665614258398,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_55777fee-68c4-4d51-9dc0-72d16789b9d0.jpg?v=1762715614"},{"product_id":"hexagon-lights-with-remote-rgb-led-wall-lights-smart-diy-app-control-music-sync-for-game-room-decor-6-eaces","title":"Hexagon Lights with Remote, RGB LED Wall Lights, Smart DIY App Control\/ Music Sync for Game Room Decor - 6 pcs","description":"\u003cp\u003e [Sync Music] With the built-in microphone, 6 music sync modes, create a unique light show, allowing you to enjoy wonderful moments at home parties and home theaters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e [Smart APP Control] Enjoy intuitive timing functions, customizable color and lighting effects, and passionate music and scene modes. 24 key 4 music mode infrared remote control, easy to operate. You can also switch the light bar via the 3-button controller, switching between static, dynamic and mic modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e [Easy to Install] With double-sided self-adhesive tape, it is easy to install the wall light to any flat surface without drilling holes and no damage to the wall.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e [Perfect Gift] This is the perfect decorative gift for friends, family birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, etc. Whether at home or at a party, this wall sconce adds style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e [LED Hexagon Lights] Combine them into various shapes according to your imagination, or choose from the recommended designs in the app, you will find more fun. Can be used as a sconce\/gaming sconce to create personalized lighting.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"SDYGDB","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":4