 your room. Quiet and safe, perfect for game room \u0026amp; teen boy room decor！\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e💯 SAFE \u0026amp; ENERGY SAVING \u0026amp; DURABLE: Our gaming neon sign is made of high-quality acrylic backboard and LED strip lights, making the light transmittance extremely strong, soft and uniform. With an advanced electrode system of 5V low voltage, quiet and noiseless, safe to touch,low energy consumption and no heat. It can work at least 50,000 hours or more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e🎁 EXCELLENT GAMER ROOM DECOR \u0026amp; GIFT: Gamer neon sign is the perfect addition to game rooms and a great decoration for boys' rooms, parties, holiday events, and clubs. This gamepad neon light is also an ideal gift for teenage boys and any gamer, and a great gift option for birthdays, Christmas, and other occasions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e🔧 EASY TO INSTALL AND USE: Pre-drilled high-quality clear backboard with 2 hooks so you can hang the neon sign on the wall or place it on your desk. Powered by a USB cord (5.9ft\/1.8m). Simply plug into your computer's port or USB port to turn on the neon sign indoors or outdoors. Very easy to install and operate.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e✅ SATISFACTORY AFTER-SALES SERVICE: We are committed to providing top-notch service to every customer. 30 days of free return and exchange service are provided. If you have any suggestions or dissatisfaction with our products, please contact us and we will solve it for you the first time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_